{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17417","headline":"惠昭皇太子挽歌词二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"惠昭皇太子挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前星落庆霄，薤露逐晨飙。\n宫仗黄麾出，仙游紫府遥。\n空嗟凤吹去，无复鸡鸣朝。\n今夜西园月，重轮更寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}